      "created_at": "2012-10-26T04:53:09.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The PEF makes the 5 lowest-HP targets regain 1 HP when a card is played ... does that count targets that are at full HP?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>For example, suppose the lowest-HP targets in play are all 5 heroes who are all damaged, and 2 of Unity's mechs, who are not damaged.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Do the 5 heroes regain HP (because the Mechs are at full), or does the card try to heal the Mechs and only 3 heroes regain HP?</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:36:28.610Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
